SUMMARY:ARDD 2026 — Aging Research & Drug Discovery — Poster abstract s
 ubmission
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Closes 31 Aug 2026\n\nCycle 2026 · Aging Pharma / ARDD\n\nEvid
 ence: "The deadline is August 31\, and decisions will be announced in Sept
 ember."\n\nCORRECTION to the master timeline\, verified live 2026-08-22. Y
 our spreadsheet says "Copenhagen\, Aug 24-28\, 2026\; abstract deadline Au
 g 10." Both are wrong for 2026: the conference is OCTOBER 1-3 in BOSTON\, 
 at Harvard\, and the abstract deadline had not passed. The page prints "Au
 gust 31" with NO YEAR — the year is inferred only because decisions are 
 announced in September for an October conference\, which the `conference_d
 ate - 400d < deadline < conference_date` validator confirms. Note the coll
 ision: the conference runs over the Rhodes national deadline. Also: ardd.e
 u is a French sustainable-development NGO\, not this.\n\nhttps://agingphar
 ma.org/registration\n\nFrom config/deadlines.yml (ardd-2026) — the YAML 
 is the source of truth\, this is a copy.
URL:https://agingpharma.org/registration
CATEGORIES:vita-radar,conferences,gating
